1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
This is the Wall of blacktongue.

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:06,080
Its signature Cent, number 5185,

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,120
was struck in 1968, carries a full

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,080
desert patina, and is a Ghost Cent.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,800
The Wall holds twenty-four Cents,

6
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,600
from 1938 to 1980.

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:21,520
Among them is one of only two Cents from 1938.

8
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:24,320
And one of nine with a full gold patina.

9
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,040
That gold, with five other Cents,

10
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,280
completes a Full Spectrum Set:

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,840
a full verdigris, a full obsidian,

12
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:34,240
a full red, a full desert,

13
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:36,320
a full gold and an orange.

14
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,440
Only nine Full Spectrum Sets can exist,

15
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,960
as there are only nine Full Gold Cents.

16
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:45,600
As of October 2026, blacktongue is the only

17
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,120
collector to hold one of these

18
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,080
rare Full Spectrum Sets.

19
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,760
Across its Cents, the Wall also covers

20
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,400
four of the twelve contamination types,

21
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,560
which makes a Contamination Set.

22
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,240
Find all of the Collector Walls

23
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,880
on cents.vision under Collectors.
